{"step_index":192,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-17T18:42:19Z","thinking":"**Designing Search Bar**\n\nOkay, I'm currently designing the top search bar. The key aspects I'm considering are a debounced search function, to avoid excessive API calls, set to 300ms. I'm also going to be using the API endpoint `https://us-central1-summaristt.cloudfunctions.net/getBooksByAuthorOrTitle?search=${search}` to get the search results. Finally, I'm considering showing the search bar on all pages except for the home page.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"use client\";\n\nimport React, { useState, useEffect, useRef } from \"react\";\nimport Image from \"next/image\";\nimport Link from \"next/link\";\nimport { useRouter } from \"next/navigation\";\nimport { AiOutlineSearch, AiOutlineLoading3Quarters } from \"react-icons/ai\";\nimport { Book } from \"@/redux/playerSlice\";\n\nexport default function Searchbar() {\n  const router = useRouter();\n  const [query, setQuery] = useState(\"\");\n  const [results, setResults] = useState<Book[]>([]);\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(false);\n  const [isOpen, setIsOpen] = useState(false);\n  const containerRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);\n\n  // Debounced search logic\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (!query.trim()) {\n      setResults([]);\n      setLoading(false);\n      return;\n    }\n\n    setLoading(true);\n    const delayDebounceFn = setTimeout(async () => {\n      try {\n        const res = await fetch(\n          `https://us-central1-summaristt.cloudfunctions.net/getBooksByAuthorOrTitle?search=${encodeURIComponent(\n            query\n          )}`\n        );\n        const data = await res.json();\n        setResults(data || []);\n      } catch (err) {\n        console.error(\"Search API Error:\", err);\n        setResults([]);\n      } finally {\n        setLoading(false);\n      }\n    }, 300);\n\n    return () => clearTimeout(delayDebounceFn);\n  }, [query]);\n\n  // Click outside to close dropdown\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const handleClickOutside = (event: MouseEvent) => {\n      if (containerRef.current && !containerRef.current.contains(event.target as Node)) {\n        setIsOpen(false);\n      }\n    };\n    document.addEventListener(\"mousedown\", handleClickOutside);\n    return () => document.removeEventListener(\"mousedown\", handleClickOutside);\n  }, []);\n\n  const handleResultClick = (id: string) => {\n    setQuery(\"\");\n    setResults([]);\n    setIsOpen(false);\n    router.push(`/book/${id}`);\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div \n      ref={containerRef} \n      className=\"relative w-full max-w-[640px] z-30\"\n    >\n      {/* Search Input Field */}\n      <div className=\"relative flex items-center w-full bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden focus-within:border-[#3ac27c] transition-all duration-200\">\n        <input\n          type=\"text\"\n          value={query}\n          onChange={(e) => {\n            setQuery(e.target.value);\n            setIsOpen(true);\n          }}\n          onFocus={() => setIsOpen(true)}\n          placeholder=\"Search by title or author...\"\n          className=\"w-full py-3.5 pl-5 pr-12 text-sm text-[#032b41] placeholder-gray-400 outline-none\"\n        />\n        <div className=\"absolute right-4 text-gray-400 pointer-events-none\">\n          {loading ? (\n            <AiOutlineLoading3Quarters size={20} className=\"animate-spin text-[#3ac27c]\" />\n          ) : (\n            <AiOutlineSearch size={22} />\n          )}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* Search Results Dropdown */}\n      {isOpen && query.trim() && (\n        <div className=\"absolute top-[calc(100%+8px)] left-0 right-0 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl shadow-xl max-h-[360px] overflow-y-auto animate-fade-in divide-y divide-gray-100\">\n          {loading ? (\n            <div className=\"p-6 flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-gray-500 gap-2 text-sm\">\n              <AiOutlineLoading3Quarters size={24} className=\"animate-spin text-[#3ac27c]\" />\n              <span>Searching books...</span>\n            </div>\n          ) : results.length > 0 ? (\n            results.map((book) => (\n              <div\n                key={book.id}\n                onClick={() => handleResultClick(book.id)}\n                className=\"flex gap-4 p-4 hover:bg-gray-50 cursor-pointer transition-colors\"\n              >\n                <div className=\"relative w-12 h-16 shrink-0 bg-gray-100 rounded overflow-hidden\">\n                  <Image\n                    src={book.imageLink}\n                    alt={book.title}\n                    fill\n                    sizes=\"48px\"\n                    className=\"object-cover\"\n                  />\n                </div>\n                <div className=\"flex flex-col justify-center min-w-0\">\n                  <span className=\"font-bold text-sm text-[#032b41] truncate hover:text-[#3ac27c] transition-colors\">\n                    {book.title}\n                  </span>\n                  <span className=\"text-xs text-gray-500 truncate mt-0.5\">\n                    {book.author}\n                  </span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            ))\n          ) : (\n            <div className=\"p-6 text-center text-gray-500 text-sm\">\n              No books found for &quot;<span className=\"font-semibold\">{query}</span>&quot;\n            </div>\n          )}\n        </div>\n      )}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n","Description":"Created scratch Searchbar.tsx in scratch directory.","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\ambat\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\c7e5dbbf-c810-4443-81c8-ce6c4ef145fb\\scratch\\Searchbar.tsx","toolAction":"Creating Searchbar file in scratch directory","toolSummary":"Write to file"}}]}
